# Local notes — tally

Machine-specific paths and tooling. **Gitignored — never commit this file.**
Copy to `.ai/local.md` and fill in. **No secrets**: `POCKETSMITH_KEY` and the
like belong in your environment (`.envrc`) or a secret store, never here.

## Vaults

Where the private data lives (selected with `--vault PATH` / `$FM_VAULT`). Each
vault holds `exports/`, `tally.db`, and optionally `tally.toml`.

- `<name>`: `/path/to/vault` — <whose data, how it is fed (CSV drop / pull)>

## Sibling checkouts

- `<other-repo>`: `/path/to/<other-repo>` — <why you'd open it>
